# Docker build context exclusions.
#
# This file must exist before the first `docker build` — without it, host
# node_modules/ (darwin-arm64 native addons) and backend/.venv/ (macOS
# cpython build) enter the Linux build context and break the build outright.
# It also keeps secrets (.env) and runtime data (db/*.db*) out of image
# layers — see threat T-05-01 in 05-01-PLAN.md.

**/node_modules
backend/.venv
frontend/.next
frontend/out
frontend/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
.git
.env
db/*.db
db/*.db-wal
db/*.db-shm
db/*.db-journal
test/node_modules
.planning
**/__pycache__
